  "description": "Decode and render DICOM images with DicomKit: native and compressed pixel data (RLE, JPEG baseline / extended / lossless, JPEG-LS, JPEG 2000) in pure managed code, modality and VOI LUTs (window center/width LINEAR, LINEAR_EXACT, SIGMOID, LUT sequences), MONOCHROME1/2, RGB, YBR and PALETTE COLOR, multi-frame, thumbnails, and PNG / JPEG export. Requires a license key: free Developer key for development and testing, Pro / Enterprise plans for production (https://dicomkit.plogic.dev).",
